# DrumMania 7th Mix power-up ver. and GuitarFreaks 8th Mix power-up ver. in session (with gtrfrk8m-session, run alongside:
# two processes on one session cable, runtime/sys573/link.h). This side hosts the multi-session
# unit. From what drmn7m-install left: NOTE 605 (Test), the boot checks and the unit's link, two coins
# and Start at the title; the WELCOME screen opens the joining period, the GuitarFreaks cabinet
# joins, then both pass CAUTION, the mode and the music select and play the first stage together.
# MAME has no session (its unit is a stub): this is HIRAKU's own, checked for repeatability.
game drmn7m

hash ram  0x80000000 0x80400000   # 4 MiB main RAM (KSEG0)

at 900 press "Service Mode" 8
at 13000 press "Coin 1" 8
at 13040 press "Coin 1" 8
from 13200 every 300 press "1 Player Start" 8
from 12000 every 300 snap
at 21000 quit
